request.description:
ADDED: POST /api/v1/presence/heartbeat

Record the user's current activity for live presence tracking in the admin panel.

Call every 45 seconds while the app is in the foreground.

Request fields:
  activity_type  string   Required. 'reading' | 'listening' | 'browsing'
  book_id        string   Required when reading/listening. UUID of current book.
  current_page   integer  Optional. Current page (for reading activity).
  session_id     string   Optional but recommended. UUID generated once per app launch.

Examples:

// User is reading:
{
  "activity_type": "reading",
  "book_id": "uuid",
  "current_page": 42,
  "session_id": "sess-uuid"
}

// User is listening:
{
  "activity_type": "listening",
  "book_id": "uuid",
  "session_id": "sess-uuid"
}

// User is browsing (no book open):
{
  "activity_type": "browsing",
  "session_id": "sess-uuid"
}

Response:
{ "success": true }

Data is used by the admin Live Monitoring panel only. No effect on user experience.
Stop sending when app goes to background.
